This is the source directory for JOREK2_particles.
Source files have been split into several directories, grouped by module.

collisions/ contains different particle-background collisions models to be implemented
diagnostics/ contains modules calculating some diagnostics, as well as simple programs executing these on output files
extra/ contains other, non-critical files, such as the load-balancing code
fields/ contains an interface for defining the field at a specific position, as well as implementations of this for JOREK and special fields
initialisation/ contains code for the particle initialisation routines
input_output/ contains HDF5 checkpoint saving code
integration/ contains extra functions needed for integration with JOREK
ion_rec/ contains code for calculating ionisation and recombination rates based on ADAS data
libs/ contains external libraries used in this project as git submodules
pushers/ contains an interface for a particle pusher, and a few implementations
tests/ contains unit and functional tests of some of this code
util/ contains several utility modules
